{"title":"项目复杂度飙升，传统管理模式早已掉队！ 项目管理必须知道的5个流程","date":"2026-07-14","content":"<h1 class=\"rich_media_title \" id=\"activity-name\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0px 0px 14px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; font-size: 22px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); line-height: 1.4; user-select: text; font-family: &quot;PingFang SC NEW&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.544px; white-space-collapse: collapse; text-align: center;\">\r\n\t<span class=\"js_title_inner\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px;\">项目复杂度飙升，传统管理模式早已掉队！</span></h1>\r\n<h1 class=\"rich_media_title \" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0px 0px 14px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; font-size: 22px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); line-height: 1.4; user-select: text; font-family: &quot;PingFang SC NEW&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.544px; white-space-collapse: collapse; text-align: center;\">\r\n\t<span class=\"js_title_inner\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px;\">项目管理必须知道的5个流程</span></h1>\r\n<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<section class=\"_editor\" style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-family: 黑体, SimHei;\">技术不断迭代，市场竞争日趋白热化，当下企业承接的项目呈现出类型多样、环节繁杂、协作链路长的特点，对管理能力提出了全新挑战。</span></p>\r\n\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-family: 黑体, SimHei;\">传统的项目管理主要依赖手工绘制的甘特图，靠经验分配资源，早就无法满足日益复杂的项目需求。</span></p>\r\n\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-family: 黑体, SimHei;\">所以，如果你想提高项目管理的效率，就要找一个高效、自动化的项目管理系统，更好地帮助企业控制项目、用数据驱动决策。</span></p>\r\n\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;font-size:15px;margin-bottom:16px;\">\r\n\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t<section data-id=\"151900\" style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t<section style=\"margin:10px auto;display:flex;justify-content:center;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"border-radius:100%;background-image:linear-gradient(to top, rgb(42, 82, 230), rgb(32, 195, 172));background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-attachment:initial;background-origin:initial;padding:4px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;background-clip:initial;-webkit-background-clip:initial;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"font-size: 24px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; color: rgb(32, 192, 174); width: 45px; height: 45px; border-radius: 100%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family:黑体, SimHei;font-size:18px;\"><strong>01</strong></span></section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n\t<h1 style=\"text-align:center;margin-left:8px;margin-right:8px;line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:40px;\">\r\n\t\t<span style=\"color:#021eaa;font-family:黑体, SimHei;font-size:18px;\"><strong><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">传统项目管理容易遇到的难题</span></strong></span></h1>\r\n\t<h1 data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"text-align:center;margin-left:8px;margin-right:8px;line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;\">\r\n\t\t&nbsp;</h1>\r\n\t<section data-id=\"132148\" style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t<section style=\"margin:10px auto;display:flex;justify-content:flex-start;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"flex-shrink:0;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"font-size:16px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(255, 255, 255);background-color:rgb(37, 137, 251);width:30px;height:30px;display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;border-radius:100%;margin-bottom:8px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family:黑体, SimHei;font-size:17px;\"><strong>01</strong></span></section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"font-size: 16px; text-align: center; padding-right: 5px; padding-left: 5px; z-index: 9; box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom:8px;font-size:15px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family:黑体, SimHei;font-size:17px;\"><strong data-brushtype=\"text\">资金监控难</strong></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;font-size:15px;margin-bottom:16px;text-indent:2.4em;\">\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-family:黑体, SimHei;font-size:17px;\">很多企业项目做完才知道亏了，做的是&ldquo;糊涂项目&rdquo;。</span></p>\r\n\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;font-size:15px;margin-bottom:16px;text-indent:2.4em;\">\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-family:黑体, SimHei;font-size:17px;\">传统管理模式下，项目资金无法实时监控，预算支出、各项成本、回款进度分散在财务、Excel、聊天记录里。</span></p>\r\n\t<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type:initial;\">\r\n\t\t<li>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;font-size:15px;margin-bottom:16px;text-indent:2.4em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family:黑体, SimHei;font-size:17px;\">预算花到哪里不知道，超支了无法提前预警</span></p>\r\n\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t<li>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;font-size:15px;margin-bottom:16px;text-indent:2.4em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family:黑体, SimHei;font-size:17px;\">回款逾期不知情，容易造成资金缺口、坏账风险</span></p>\r\n\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t<li>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;font-size:15px;margin-bottom:16px;text-indent:2.4em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family:黑体, SimHei;font-size:17px;\">财务报表人工统计，耗时、滞后、容易出错</span></p>\r\n\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t<li>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;font-size:15px;margin-bottom:16px;text-indent:2.4em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family:黑体, SimHei;font-size:17px;\">项目真实利润模糊，赚钱亏钱全靠月底复盘</span></p>\r\n\t\t</li>\r\n\t</ul>\r\n\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;font-size:15px;margin-bottom:16px;text-indent:2.4em;\">\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-family:黑体, SimHei;font-size:17px;\">资金黑箱，是企业项目利润变薄的第一大元凶。</span></p>\r\n\t<h1 data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"text-align:center;margin-left:8px;margin-right:8px;line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:40px;\">\r\n\t\t&nbsp;</h1>\r\n\t<section data-id=\"132148\" style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t<section style=\"margin:10px auto;display:flex;justify-content:flex-start;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"flex-shrink:0;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"font-size:16px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(255, 255, 255);background-color:rgb(37, 137, 251);width:30px;height:30px;display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;border-radius:100%;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family:黑体, SimHei;font-size:17px;\"><strong>02</strong></span></section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"font-size: 16px; text-align: center; padding-right: 5px; padding-left: 5px; z-index: 9; box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family:黑体, SimHei;font-size:17px;\"><strong data-brushtype=\"text\">进度把控难</strong></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;font-size:15px;margin-bottom:16px;text-indent:2.4em;\">\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-family:黑体, SimHei;font-size:17px;\">项目延期，90%不是做不完，是信息不通、资料混乱、进度滞后。</span></p>\r\n\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;font-size:15px;margin-bottom:16px;text-indent:2.4em;\">\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-family:黑体, SimHei;font-size:17px;\">传统协作没有统一平台，文件版本混乱、资料散落电脑、进度靠层层汇报。</span></p>\r\n\t<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type:initial;\">\r\n\t\t<li>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;font-size:15px;margin-bottom:16px;text-indent:2.4em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family:黑体, SimHei;font-size:17px;\">各部门信息不同步，数据版本不统一，沟通反复扯皮</span></p>\r\n\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t<li>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;font-size:15px;margin-bottom:16px;text-indent:2.4em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family:黑体, SimHei;font-size:17px;\">任务进度更新不及时，卡点隐蔽，问题爆发才发现</span></p>\r\n\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t<li>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;font-size:15px;margin-bottom:16px;text-indent:2.4em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family:黑体, SimHei;font-size:17px;\">项目资料无统一归档，查找难、追溯难、复盘难</span></p>\r\n\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t<li>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;font-size:15px;margin-bottom:16px;text-indent:2.4em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family:黑体, SimHei;font-size:17px;\">计划赶不上变化，项目调整完全被动</span></p>\r\n\t\t</li>\r\n\t</ul>\r\n\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;font-size:15px;margin-bottom:16px;text-indent:2.4em;\">\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-family:黑体, SimHei;font-size:17px;\">看似每天都在推进，实则流程不透明、过程不可控、进度不可视。</span></p>\r\n\t<h1 data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"text-align:center;margin-left:8px;margin-right:8px;line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:40px;\">\r\n\t\t&nbsp;</h1>\r\n\t<section data-id=\"132148\" style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t<section style=\"margin:10px auto;display:flex;justify-content:flex-start;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"flex-shrink:0;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"font-size:16px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(255, 255, 255);background-color:rgb(37, 137, 251);width:30px;height:30px;display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;border-radius:100%;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family:黑体, SimHei;font-size:17px;\"><strong>03</strong></span></section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"font-size: 16px; text-align: center; padding-right: 5px; padding-left: 5px; z-index: 9; box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family:黑体, SimHei;font-size:17px;\"><strong data-brushtype=\"text\">人员管理难</strong></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;font-size:15px;margin-bottom:16px;text-indent:2.4em;\">\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-family:黑体, SimHei;font-size:17px;\">很多项目看似人工成本高，实则根本不知道钱花在哪。</span></p>\r\n\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;font-size:15px;margin-bottom:16px;text-indent:2.4em;\">\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-family:黑体, SimHei;font-size:17px;\">传统项目工时靠员工手动填报、事后补填，数据失真严重；管理者看不到团队真实负载，派单分配全凭经验。</span></p>\r\n\t<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type:initial;\">\r\n\t\t<li>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;font-size:15px;margin-bottom:16px;text-indent:2.4em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family:黑体, SimHei;font-size:17px;\">项目工时统计不实时，投入成本模糊不清</span></p>\r\n\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t<li>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;font-size:15px;margin-bottom:16px;text-indent:2.4em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family:黑体, SimHei;font-size:17px;\">无法精准核算单项目利润、人力成本</span></p>\r\n\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t<li>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;font-size:15px;margin-bottom:16px;text-indent:2.4em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family:黑体, SimHei;font-size:17px;\">员工工作量不均衡，有人超负荷、有人闲置</span></p>\r\n\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t<li>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;font-size:15px;margin-bottom:16px;text-indent:2.4em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family:黑体, SimHei;font-size:17px;\">资源分配不合理，造成大量人力内耗与浪费</span></p>\r\n\t\t</li>\r\n\t</ul>\r\n\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;font-size:15px;margin-bottom:16px;text-indent:2.4em;\">\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-family:黑体, SimHei;font-size:17px;\">人力成本越来越贵，管理却越来越粗放，企业自然越做越累。</span></p>\r\n\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;font-size:15px;margin-bottom:16px;\">\r\n\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t<section data-id=\"151900\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t<section style=\"margin:10px auto;display:flex;justify-content:center;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"border-radius:100%;background-image:linear-gradient(to top, rgb(42, 82, 230), rgb(32, 195, 172));background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-attachment:initial;background-origin:initial;padding:4px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;background-clip:initial;-webkit-background-clip:initial;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"font-size: 24px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; color: rgb(32, 192, 174); width: 45px; height: 45px; border-radius: 100%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family:黑体, SimHei;font-size:18px;\"><strong>02</strong></span></section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n\t<h1 style=\"text-align:center;margin-left:8px;margin-right:8px;line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:40px;\">\r\n\t\t<span style=\"color:#021eaa;font-family:黑体, SimHei;font-size:18px;\"><strong><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">为什么需要项目管理系统？</span></strong></span></h1>\r\n\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-family: 黑体, SimHei;\">过去项目简单、业务单一，靠人工、靠表格、靠经验还能撑得住。</span></p>\r\n\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-family: 黑体, SimHei;\">但现在的项目是动态的、多变的、复杂的。</span></p>\r\n\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-family: 黑体, SimHei;\">市场在变、需求在变、工期在紧、成本在涨，静态的人工管理，根本扛不住动态的项目变化。</span></p>\r\n\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-family: 黑体, SimHei;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(179, 124, 1);\" textstyle=\"\">数字化项目管理系统，彻底颠覆传统管理模式，把项目从</span><span style=\"color: rgb(179, 124, 1);\" textstyle=\"\">&ldquo;混乱失控&rdquo;变成&ldquo;全程可控&rdquo;</span>：</span></p>\r\n\t<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type:initial;\">\r\n\t\t<li>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family: 黑体, SimHei;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(122, 79, 214);\" textstyle=\"\">打通信息壁垒，沟通效率翻倍</span>:所有任务、消息、进度、文档统一沉淀在系统内，告别碎片化沟通，信息零失真、零滞后。</span></p>\r\n\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t<li>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family: 黑体, SimHei;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(122, 79, 214);\" textstyle=\"\">进度可视化，全程不翻车:</span>甘特图、进度看板实时更新，每个节点、每个任务状态清晰可见，风险提前预警，彻底告别延期救火。</span></p>\r\n\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t<li>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family: 黑体, SimHei;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(122, 79, 214);\" textstyle=\"\">资源智能分配，杜绝人力浪费:</span>团队负载一目了然，根据工作量科学派单，均衡团队产能，最大化利用人力资源。</span></p>\r\n\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t<li>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family: 黑体, SimHei;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(122, 79, 214);\" textstyle=\"\">资金实时监控，利润看得见:</span>预算、成本、支出、回款全程线上记录，数据实时同步，报表自动生成，每一个项目的盈亏，随时看得清。</span></p>\r\n\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t<li>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family: 黑体, SimHei;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(122, 79, 214);\" textstyle=\"\">数据驱动决策，告别经验管理:</span>进度数据、成本数据、工时数据、绩效数据自动沉淀，用真实数据做判断，管理更科学、决策更精准。</span></p>\r\n\t\t</li>\r\n\t</ul>\r\n\t<section data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.898); font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; white-space-collapse: collapse; text-align: center; margin-bottom: unset; max-width: 100% !important;\">\r\n\t\t<p style=\"font-size: 15px;\">\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t</section>\r\n\t<section data-id=\"151900\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t<section style=\"margin:10px auto;display:flex;justify-content:center;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"border-radius:100%;background-image:linear-gradient(to top, rgb(42, 82, 230), rgb(32, 195, 172));background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-attachment:initial;background-origin:initial;padding:4px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;background-clip:initial;-webkit-background-clip:initial;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"font-size: 24px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; color: rgb(32, 192, 174); width: 45px; height: 45px; border-radius: 100%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family:黑体, SimHei;font-size:18px;\"><strong>03</strong></span></section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n\t<h1 style=\"text-align:center;margin-left:8px;margin-right:8px;line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:40px;\">\r\n\t\t<span style=\"color:#021eaa;font-family:黑体, SimHei;font-size:18px;\"><strong><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">如何用项目管理系统打通5个流程？</span></strong></span></h1>\r\n\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-family: 黑体, SimHei;\">项目管理通常都分为五个阶段&mdash;&mdash;<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">启动、规划、执行、监控、收尾</span>。</span></p>\r\n\t<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type:initial;\">\r\n\t\t<li>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family: 黑体, SimHei;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 82, 255); font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">启动</span>：确立项目的合法地位和总体要求，宣布项目正式立项</span></p>\r\n\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t<li>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family: 黑体, SimHei;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 82, 255); font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">规划</span>：编制项目计划，把项目目标具体化，制定达到目标的路线图</span></p>\r\n\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t<li>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family: 黑体, SimHei;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 82, 255); font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">执行</span>：按计划开展项目活动，把纸面上的成果变成实实在在的成果</span></p>\r\n\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t<li>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family: 黑体, SimHei;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 82, 255); font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">监控</span>：把实际情况与计划要求进行比较，发现偏差，分析偏差，并在必要时进行变更</span></p>\r\n\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t<li>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family: 黑体, SimHei;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 82, 255); font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">收尾</span>：按序开展收尾工作，项目正式完成</span></p>\r\n\t\t</li>\r\n\t</ul>\r\n\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-family: 黑体, SimHei;\">这五大过程组之间彼此独立，界限清晰。项目管理系统在每个流程都能发挥作用，帮企业实现高效管理和流畅协作：</span></p>\r\n\t<p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"text-align:justify;margin-left:8px;margin-right:8px;margin-bottom:8px;line-height:1.75em;font-size:17px;\">\r\n\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t<section style=\"margin-top:24px;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t<section style=\"margin:10px auto;display:flex;justify-content:flex-start;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"flex-shrink:0;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"font-size:16px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(255, 255, 255);background-color:rgb(37, 137, 251);width:30px;height:30px;display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;border-radius:100%;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family:黑体, SimHei;font-size:17px;\"><strong>01</strong></span></section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"font-size: 16px; text-align: center; padding-right: 5px; padding-left: 5px; z-index: 9; box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family:黑体, SimHei;font-size:17px;\"><strong data-brushtype=\"text\">项目启动：目标设定和细化两步走</strong></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-family: 黑体, SimHei;\">目标制定是项目启动阶段的关键一步。在系统中，项目负责人<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">可以利用</span><span style=\"color: rgb(122, 79, 214); font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">目标管理模块</span>，<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">设定项目的总体目标，并把这个目标细化为多个子目标</span>，以及设定相应的关键绩效指标。</span></p>\r\n\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:24px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-family: 黑体, SimHei;\">系统能够自动将目标和子目标分配到各个相关的团队或成员，让每个人都清楚自己的工作方向与总体目标的关联。</span></p>\r\n\t<section data-id=\"132148\" style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t<section style=\"margin:10px auto;display:flex;justify-content:flex-start;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"flex-shrink:0;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"font-size:16px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(255, 255, 255);background-color:rgb(37, 137, 251);width:30px;height:30px;display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;border-radius:100%;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family:黑体, SimHei;font-size:17px;\"><strong>02</strong></span></section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"font-size: 16px; text-align: center; padding-right: 5px; padding-left: 5px; z-index: 9; box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family:黑体, SimHei;font-size:17px;\"><strong><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">项目规划：一张表搞定全生命周期</span></strong></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-family: 黑体, SimHei;\">在规划阶段，项目负责人需要统筹全局，给成员安排任务、分配资源，这就需要对项目的各种数据全盘掌握。</span></p>\r\n\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:24px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-family: 黑体, SimHei;\">有了项目管理系统，就能<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">打通项目的</span><span style=\"color: rgb(122, 79, 214); font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">全生命周期数据</span>，<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">比如项目档案、变更记录、工单日报、合同信息，随用随查，让项目规划更有抓手</span>。同时支持共享项目资料，每个人都能充分掌握项目信息。</span></p>\r\n\t<section data-id=\"132148\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t<section style=\"margin:10px auto;display:flex;justify-content:flex-start;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"flex-shrink:0;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"font-size:16px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(255, 255, 255);background-color:rgb(37, 137, 251);width:30px;height:30px;display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;border-radius:100%;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family:黑体, SimHei;font-size:17px;\"><strong>03</strong></span></section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"font-size: 16px; text-align: center; padding-right: 5px; padding-left: 5px; z-index: 9; box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family:黑体, SimHei;font-size:17px;\"><strong><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">项目执行：团队分工清晰可见</span></strong></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n\t<p style=\"margin-bottom:24px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-family: 黑体, SimHei;\">项目执行离不开合理的团队分工，才能实现高效的团队协作。</span></p>\r\n\t<p style=\"margin-bottom:8px;font-size:15px;text-indent:2.4em;\">\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-family:黑体, SimHei;font-size:17px;\">项目经理如果想了解成员的工作任务和完成情况，用项目管理系统的</span><span style=\"font-family:黑体, SimHei;font-size:17px;color:#7a4fd6;font-weight:bold;\" textstyle=\"\">工时看板</span><span style=\"font-family:黑体, SimHei;font-size:17px;\">，</span><span style=\"font-family:黑体, SimHei;font-size:17px;font-weight:bold;\" textstyle=\"\">就能一键获取员工承接项目与交付情况</span><span style=\"font-family:黑体, SimHei;font-size:17px;\">。系统还会实时更新项目的工时成本，让管理变得更方便。</span></p>\r\n\t<section data-id=\"132148\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t<section style=\"margin:10px auto;display:flex;justify-content:flex-start;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"flex-shrink:0;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"font-size:16px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(255, 255, 255);background-color:rgb(37, 137, 251);width:30px;height:30px;display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;border-radius:100%;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family:黑体, SimHei;font-size:17px;\"><strong>0</strong><strong class=\"_num\" data-num=\"3\" data-original-title=\"\" title=\"\">4</strong></span></section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"font-size: 16px; text-align: center; padding-right: 5px; padding-left: 5px; z-index: 9; box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family:黑体, SimHei;font-size:17px;\"><strong><strong><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">项目监控：项目进度和财务管理两手抓</span></strong></strong></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:24px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-family: 黑体, SimHei;\">在监控阶段，项目经理只有实时把握项目进度，才能及时调整项目安排，优化执行情况或避免项目损失。系统能根据项目类型一键生成所有阶段，并<span style=\"color: rgb(122, 79, 214); font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">通过甘特图实时更新进度</span>，<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">在关键节点自动提醒，大大提升工作效率</span>。</span></p>\r\n\t<p style=\"margin-top:24px;line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:24px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-family: 黑体, SimHei;\">除了项目进度，成本同样是项目监控的重点。在系统上，<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">财务数据录入即计算，计算即可见，实时监控项目成本，如预算消耗进度、回款及时性</span>，帮助项目团队更有效地控制成本、提高资金利用效率。</span></p>\r\n\t<section data-id=\"132148\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t<section style=\"margin:10px auto;display:flex;justify-content:flex-start;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"flex-shrink:0;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"font-size:16px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(255, 255, 255);background-color:rgb(37, 137, 251);width:30px;height:30px;display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;border-radius:100%;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family:黑体, SimHei;font-size:17px;\"><strong>05</strong></span></section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"font-size: 16px; text-align: center; padding-right: 5px; padding-left: 5px; z-index: 9; box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family:黑体, SimHei;font-size:17px;\"><strong data-brushtype=\"text\">项目收尾：用数据讲好故事</strong></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:24px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-family: 黑体, SimHei;\">开头简单、结局不易，项目收尾做得好，能让整个项目管理再上一个台阶。这个阶段需要<span style=\"color: rgb(122, 79, 214); font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">用数据讲好故事，摆成果做高质量汇报</span>。</span></p>\r\n\t<p style=\"margin-bottom:8px;line-height:1.75em;font-size:15px;text-indent:2.4em;\">\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-family:黑体, SimHei;font-size:17px;\">针对数据汇总困难、数据分析耗时的汇报痛点，管家婆CRM项目管理系统提供了统一数据协同工具、支持快速搭建数据大屏，大大缩短了汇报类工作的时间投入。</span></p>\r\n</section>\r\n<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>"}